# Paired Dual-Gather Route: Herbalism + Mining 1-300 (WoW: Forever)
# Research: mining-herbalism-farming/outline.yaml + fields.yaml
# Follows docs/MULTI_PROFESSION_RULES.md:
# - File: guides/pairs/herbalism-mining.guide
# - Mining is the section anchor (rising Mining bands only)
# - Herbalism trains and farm loops are interleaved inside each band
# - Tracker rule: Find Minerals OR Find Herbs — never both; tips say when to toggle
# - Farm loops / gotos come from Forever objects.json centroids already verified
#   in guides/mining.guide and guides/herbalism.guide (Forever 1.60.1 only)
# - Fishing pools: deferred (see outline) — not part of this guide
#
# Dual-gather gold: 0 Legacy Points; sells into Alchemy / BS / Engineering demand,
# including Forever Scarce mats (Frilled Lichen, Rosecap, Stranglevine, Pyrite,
# Bauxite, Pitchblende).

guide forever-professions/pair-herbalism-mining
title Herbalism + Mining 1-300
category Professions
folder Paired Routes
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth
keywords herbalism, mining, paired, gathering, farming, scarce, gold
pitch Level Herbalism and Mining together from 1 to 300 on Forever farm circuits, toggling Find Herbs and Find Minerals between laps.
pro Both primary slots gather into gold and scarce mats without buying craft reagents
pro Farm loops use Forever node spawn data already proven in the solo Mining and Herbalism guides
pro Hoard Frilled Lichen, Rosecap, Stranglevine, Pyrite, Bauxite and Pitchblende for crafters
con No Legacy Points (gathering awards none)
con Only one tracker works at a time — expect alternate herb and ore laps in shared zones

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

section Mining 1-65

step Learn Herbalism and Mining
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Dual-gather uses both primary slots and earns no Legacy Points — you farm gold and scarce mats instead. Learn Apprentice Herbalism from Nancy Songflower and Apprentice Mining from Kelsey Fargo in Elwynn. Buy a Mining Pick. Drag Find Herbs and Find Minerals to your bar: only one can stay on, and both turn off when you die. For this starter band, run herb laps with Find Herbs, then switch to Find Minerals for copper.
  train Herbalism Apprentice npc 247223
  train Mining Apprentice npc 247226
  buy 2901 x1 nearest

step Learn Herbalism and Mining
  only Horde
  zone Durotar
  tip Dual-gather uses both primary slots and earns no Legacy Points — you farm gold and scarce mats instead. Learn Apprentice Herbalism from Zor'la and Apprentice Mining from Norzsh in the Valley of Trials. Buy a Mining Pick. Drag Find Herbs and Find Minerals to your bar: only one can stay on, and both turn off when you die. For this starter band, run herb laps with Find Herbs, then switch to Find Minerals for copper.
  train Herbalism Apprentice npc 267329
  train Mining Apprentice npc 267328
  buy 2901 x1 nearest

step Starter herbs (Elwynn)
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Find Herbs on. Circle Peacebloom, Silverleaf, Earthroot (15+), Wilted Peacebloom and Stunted Silverleaf to Herbalism 70. Keep Frilled Lichen if it drops.
