step Dual Hillsbrad — herb lap
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Shared dual-gather zone. Find Herbs on first: Bruiseweed, Wild Steelbloom, Kingsblood (125), Liferoot (150) to Herbalism 170. Then flip the tracker for ore if you still need Mining points here, or move to Arathi for iron.
